            <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-2 mb-8 sm:mb-10">
              <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-label font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white/90 bg-white/20 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/30">
                A STEP-BY-STEP PATHWAY
              </span>
              <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-white">
                Your 4-Step Journey to Parenthood
              </h2>
              <p class="text-white/85 text-xs sm:text-sm font-sans">
                Clear, transparent, and guided medical care from initial assessment to healthy delivery.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 sm:gap-6">
              
              {/* Step 1 */}
              <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md rounded-[22px] p-5 border border-white/20 space-y-3">
                <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white text-[#E4006E] font-bold font-heading flex items-center justify-center text-sm shadow-xs">
                  01
                </div>
                <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-white">Comprehensive Diagnosis</h3>
                <p class="text-white/80 text-xs font-sans leading-relaxed">
                  In-depth dual evaluation, hormonal profiling, ovarian reserve testing, and advanced semen analysis.
                </p>
              </div>

              {/* Step 2 */}
              <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md rounded-[22px] p-5 border border-white/20 space-y-3">
                <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white text-[#E4006E] font-bold font-heading flex items-center justify-center text-sm shadow-xs">
                  02
                </div>
                <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-white">Tailored Treatment Plan</h3>
                <p class="text-white/80 text-xs font-sans leading-relaxed">
                  Customized protocol selection—from gentle IUI to advanced IVF, ICSI, or PICSI—tailored for you.
                </p>
              </div>

              {/* Step 3 */}
              <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md rounded-[22px] p-5 border border-white/20 space-y-3">
                <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white text-[#E4006E] font-bold font-heading flex items-center justify-center text-sm shadow-xs">
                  03
                </div>
                <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-white">State-of-the-Art ART</h3>
                <p class="text-white/80 text-xs font-sans leading-relaxed">
                  Precision micromanipulation, clean-room embryology, and Day-5 blastocyst culture for max success.
                </p>
              </div>

              {/* Step 4 */}
              <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md rounded-[22px] p-5 border border-white/20 space-y-3">
                <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white text-[#E4006E] font-bold font-heading flex items-center justify-center text-sm shadow-xs">
                  04
                </div>
                <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-white">Care Through Pregnancy</h3>
                <p class="text-white/80 text-xs font-sans leading-relaxed">
                  Expert fetal medicine screening, ultrasound monitoring, and empathetic support at every trimester.
                </p>
              </div>

            </div>

          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* ── 7. MEDICAL SPECIALIST LEADERSHIP SECTION: DR. P. BHARATHI (PINK BACKGROUND) ── */}
